WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.266
Not bad at all.

2
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.866
Finding a gob of grub in the middle of nowhere

3
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:22.200
- makes no sense at all.
- You're wrong.

4
