All right, who's laughing at us?

7
00:00:45.466 --> 00:00:47.800
Yeah, stop laughing and show yourself.

8
00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:48.866
Wobbuffet.

9
00:00:54.433 --> 00:00:55.833
Who are those blobs?

10
00:00:56.066 --> 00:00:59.200
Hmm. Let's see. I'd say they're Phantump.

11
00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:02.033
Phantump. Phantump. Phantump.

12
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Some translation, if you please.

13
00:01:04.566 --> 00:01:08.966
It says gobbling up all their goodies without permission is a big no-no.

14
00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:11.900
I don't recall seeing "Phantump" written on them.

15
00:01:11.966 --> 00:01:14.533
Huh. Finders keepers, losers weepers.

16
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.633
These treats are ours.

17
00:01:18.066 --> 00:01:19.400
- Let go!
- Phantump.

18
00:01:19.466 --> 00:01:21.500
- Don't be so greedy!
- Phantump.

19
00:01:23.533 --> 00:01:24.400
Phantump.

20
00:01:28.566 --> 00:01:30.900
What kind of gross move is that?

21
00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.166
Get your grossness off of us!

22
00:01:33.633 --> 00:01:36.966
This is a lot of hubbub for stealing some stupid grub!

23
00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:37.866
Wobbuffet!

24
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:42.866
In that case, we'll eat even more! You'll pay with your empty stomachs!

25
00:01:42.933 --> 00:01:43.900
Phantump!

26
00:01:49.533 --> 00:01:51.266
This macaron is mine!

27
00:01:52.366 --> 00:01:55.100
- Let go, let go, let go!
- Phantump, Phantump.

28
00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:56.666
- Get lost!
- Phantump!

29
00:01:57.133 --> 00:01:58.533
Phantump.

30
00:01:58.800 --> 00:01:59.633
Phantump.

31
00:02:06.966 --> 00:02:08.199
Phantump. Phantump.

32
00:02:08.733 --> 00:02:09.766
Phantump.

33
00:02:10.633 --> 00:02:11.566
I can't wait.

34
00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:15.600
Special training for the Snowbelle Gym. It's gonna be awesome.

35
00:02:15.666 --> 00:02:16.800
Pikachu!

36
00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:21.000
Hmm?

37
00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:27.166
Look. Something's fall--

38
00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.733
- Pika!
- Ash, no!

39
00:02:31.533 --> 00:02:32.366
Phantump.

40
00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:36.300
- Pika, pi.
- Okay. Pikachu, Thunderbolt.

41
00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:45.333
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

42
00:02:45.966 --> 00:02:48.966
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

43
00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:53.000
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

44
00:02:53.066 --> 00:02:54.266
♪ Pokémon ♪

45
00:02:54.933 --> 00:02:56.200
♪ Pokémon ♪

46
00:02:56.266 --> 00:02:57.366
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

47
00:02:57.433 --> 00:03:00.733
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

48
00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:01.900
♪ Pokémon ♪

49
00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:03.933
♪ Pokémon ♪

50
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.266
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

51
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.133
During their long journey to the Snowbelle City Gym,

52
00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.200
a Phantump has dropped in on our heroes at the foot of a mountain.

53
00:03:23.266 --> 00:03:25.933
- Ash, how are you? Are you okay?
- Yeah.

54
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.766
Phantump, Phantump, Phantump.

55
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.433
- Think it fell out of a tree?
- No. It fell from the sky.

56
00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.300
- I saw it.
- I wonder how it got up there.

57
00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.633
Phantump, the Stump Pokémon.

58
00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:43.866
Phantump come from rotting tree stumps that are possessed by spirits.

59
00:03:43.933 --> 00:03:46.633
Lonely forests are their preferred habitat.

60
00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.333
Different color than the one in the Pokédex.

61
00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.900
What an amazing sight. That's a rarity.

62
00:03:51.966 --> 00:03:53.666
It's so cute.

63
00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:56.666
- Nice to meet you, Phantump.
- Phantump.

64
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.633
Phan. Phan. Phan. Phantump, phan.

65
00:04:01.466 --> 00:04:03.600
Phantump!

66
00:04:05.466 --> 00:04:07.900
- Dedenne!
- Pika! Pi, pika!

67
00:04:07.966 --> 00:04:11.033
- Is Phantump using a move?
- It's called Forest's Curse!

68
00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.700
Hey, wait! Please!

69
00:04:14.166 --> 00:04:16.166
Pikachu, Iron Tail! Let's go!

70
00:04:16.533 --> 00:04:18.766
Chu, pika!

71
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:20.433
Yeah! Way to go, Pikachu!

72
00:04:22.466 --> 00:04:23.933
What was that all about?

73
00:04:24.333 --> 00:04:25.400
Pika.

74
00:04:25.966 --> 00:04:28.966
The Pokédex said Phantump live in remote forests.

75
00:04:29.033 --> 00:04:32.400
I'd say it's highly unusual for one to live around here.

76
00:04:32.466 --> 00:04:36.733
It says Phantump live in large trees and imitate the sound of children.

77
00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:40.966
They use the sounds to lure people into the forest and get them lost.

78
00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:43.666
- That's how the story goes.
- That's so cool.

79
00:04:43.733 --> 00:04:46.666
- I wanna hear them sound like children.
- Dedenne!

80
00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:51.200
I don't ever wanna hear them. I never wanna get lost in the forest.

81
00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.233
I don't wanna get lost either.

82
00:04:54.533 --> 00:04:56.900
Sorry about that. Guess I'm hungry.

83
00:04:57.433 --> 00:04:58.933
Pika, pika.

84
00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:01.933
Look what I've got. Want one?

85
00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.466
Yeah, that'd be great.

86
00:05:03.533 --> 00:05:05.100
Thanks a lot, Serena.

87
00:05:06.866 --> 00:05:08.933
- So, down the hatch.
- Phantump.

88
00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.733
Bring that back! That's mine!

89
00:05:16.266 --> 00:05:19.133
I think this Phantump likes yummy sweets.

90
00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:22.500
- Do you have any more, Serena?
- More? Uh-huh.

91
00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:25.000
Here.

92
00:05:25.533 --> 00:05:27.233
Do you want this, too?

93
00:05:29.533 --> 00:05:30.666
Phantump.

94
00:05:31.266 --> 00:05:33.166
Hey, where are your friends?

95
00:05:34.633 --> 00:05:37.200
Are you all alone? Are you scared?

96
00:05:37.266 --> 00:05:38.566
Phantump.

97
00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:44.333
- Do you think it could be lost perhaps?
- If it is, we know what to do.

98
00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.933
- Get it back to its friends.
- How are we going to do that?

99
00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:51.733
Hey, would you look and see if there's a big tree around here?

100
00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:52.666
Ah!

101
00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.400
Hold on a minute.

102
00:05:55.166 --> 00:05:58.900
There's one at the top of the mountain. Yup. Here.

103
00:05:59.366 --> 00:06:02.200
Long ago, many people got lost in those woods

104
00:06:02.266 --> 00:06:05.266
because they'd be led astray by children's voices.

105
00:06:05.466 --> 00:06:08.933
So, people built a place to leave treats for the Phantump.

106
00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:12.366
Then the voices stopped and people stopped getting lost.

107
00:06:12.433 --> 00:06:15.433
Looks like people are still leaving treats there.

108
00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.666
Phantump. Phantump.

109
00:06:16.733 --> 00:06:20.600
So, that's that. Let's climb up to the top right away!

110
00:06:20.866 --> 00:06:22.100
Pika, pika!

111
00:06:22.166 --> 00:06:25.433
Doesn't that sound great? We can take you back to your friends.

112
00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.133
- Denn-enne.
- Phantump.

113
00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.433
Phantump? Something wrong?

114
00:06:35.733 --> 00:06:37.100
Phantump.

115
00:06:41.366 --> 00:06:43.400
Diglett! Diglett, Diglett, dig.

116
00:06:43.866 --> 00:06:47.266
- Wow, check out the Diglett.
- Diglett. Diglett, Diglett.

117
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:49.933
- Diglett, Diglett, dig.
- Dug, dug, dug.

118
00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.000
Diglett, Diglett, dig.

119
00:06:51.066 --> 00:06:52.333
Pika, pika, pika!

120
00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.766
Denne, denne, denne!

121
00:06:53.833 --> 00:06:54.900
Everything's fine.

122
00:06:54.966 --> 00:06:59.500
- Diglett and Dugtrio are really friendly.
- Yeah, they're just saying hello.

123
00:06:59.966 --> 00:07:02.866
- Diglett, Diglett, dig.
- Dug, dug, dug.

124
00:07:02.933 --> 00:07:04.333
Diglett, Diglett, dig.

125
00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:05.800
Denne!

126
00:07:05.866 --> 00:07:06.833
Pikachu.

127
00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.400
Phantump.

128
00:07:08.466 --> 00:07:12.733
I think that's the first time this Phantump's met a Diglett or Dugtrio.

129
00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:13.633
Wow, you think?

130
00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.333
Probably the first time it's away from home.

131
00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:25.900
Yeah. It must have been really surprised when it first saw all of us, too.

132
00:07:26.066 --> 00:07:29.333
Phantump, there are lots of Pokémon out in the world.

133
00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:32.633
Nice ones, fun ones, all kinds of different ones.

134
00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:38.066
You should meet tons of Pokémon and make lots of new friends, okay?

135
00:07:38.133 --> 00:07:39.766
- Pika, pika.
- Denne.

136
00:07:39.833 --> 00:07:41.400
Phantump.

137
00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:43.833
Phantump.

138
00:07:44.333 --> 00:07:47.333
- Wait up! Ha, ha!
- Don't get too far ahead!

139
00:07:52.466 --> 00:07:53.700
- Wow.
- Pika!

140
00:07:56.166 --> 00:07:57.966
What a view. Awesome.

141
00:07:59.366 --> 00:08:01.900
Ah. And the air is so fresh.

142
00:08:01.966 --> 00:08:03.466
Pika, pika.

143
00:08:03.533 --> 00:08:06.533
- How about we take a little rest here?
- Good idea.

144
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:07.866
Okay.

145
00:08:08.866 --> 00:08:11.266
