Phantump-tump.

147
00:08:17.933 --> 00:08:21.000
Why don't we have a snack? I've got homemade macarons.

148
00:08:21.066 --> 00:08:21.900
Yay!

149
00:08:21.966 --> 00:08:23.700
Phantump.

150
00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.200
Ta-da! Here you go!

151
00:08:27.166 --> 00:08:28.333
So yummy.

152
00:08:29.433 --> 00:08:30.633
Huh?

153
00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:31.566
Chespin!

154
00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:33.833
Che! Che!

155
