Oh, no, not Chespin.

156
00:08:38.133 --> 00:08:39.533
Che?

157
00:08:40.066 --> 00:08:40.966
Phan?

158
00:08:41.533 --> 00:08:42.900
Phantump, phan-phantump.

159
00:08:46.533 --> 00:08:47.533
Phan-phantump.

160
00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.533
Phantump.

161
00:08:52.766 --> 00:08:54.800
Chespin. Chespin.

162
