170
00:09:14.066 --> 00:09:17.500
- It's feeling homesick.
- You'll be back with your buddies

171
00:09:17.566 --> 00:09:20.600
- before you know it.
- Just a little farther to go.

172
00:09:20.666 --> 00:09:24.466
