- Soon as you're done eating, we'll go.

174
00:09:30.533 --> 00:09:31.466
Helioptile.

175
00:09:31.533 --> 00:09:33.100
Look, it's a Helioptile.

176
00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.100
Pika, pika.

177
00:09:34.566 --> 00:09:36.700
Now, this is a Helioptile. See?

178
00:09:36.766 --> 00:09:37.600
Phantump.

179
00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.766
- Denne.
- Heliop.

180
00:09:40.833 --> 00:09:43.500
