- Chespin.

189
00:10:14.733 --> 00:10:16.500
- Phantump.
- Bibarel.

190
00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:20.266
Phantump's getting used to meeting Pokémon.

191
00:10:20.333 --> 00:10:25.333
Yay. There's nothing to be afraid of. Let's make a whole lot of new friends.

192
00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.266
Phantump.

193
00:10:27.566 --> 00:10:31.633
I wonder if the twerps wanna schlep that Phantump back to its home.

194
00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:36.466
Forest's Curse is one treacherous move. It might wreck our Pikachu plan.

195
00:10:36.533 --> 00:10:39.066
- We need to separate that bunch.
- But how?

196
00:10:39.133 --> 00:10:42.266
- It might hand us our lunch.
- The answer is clear.

197
00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.433
