- Acting?

198
00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:46.666
How will that help?

199
00:10:46.766 --> 00:10:47.766
Wobbu?

200
00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:51.533
With a convincing performance leveled at that group,

201
00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.866
Phantump will be gone, but Pikachu won't.

202
00:10:56.733 --> 00:10:58.033
Wobbu.

203
00:10:59.266 --> 00:11:01.366
Who's that Pokémon?

204
00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:09.133
- It's Phantump!
- Phantump!

205
00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:16.033
You're gonna make more friends than you can believe.

206
00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:16.933
Dedenne.

207
00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.333
Phantump.

208
00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.433
- Kirlia!
- Look. Up ahead.

209
00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:24.733
