- And a Gallade and a Gardevoir.

210
00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.166
And a Ralts, too!

211
00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:31.733
What luck. All of its evolved forms standing here in one place.

212
00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.633
- Gardevoir.
- Gallade.

213
00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:36.500
Be chummy with Phantump and get it out of here.

214
00:11:36.566 --> 00:11:39.866
Where you take it is up to you. Remember, acting.

215
00:11:40.066 --> 00:11:41.766
Right. Like a pro.

216
