221
00:11:57.933 --> 00:11:58.900
Pika!

222
00:11:59.266 --> 00:12:00.500
Phantump.

223
00:12:00.566 --> 00:12:01.700
- Now.
- Roger.

224
00:12:01.766 --> 00:12:02.800
Wobbu.

225
00:12:02.866 --> 00:12:04.800
Gardevoir.

226
