- Let's go.
- Pika, pika!

227
00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.566
Hey, wait for me!

228
00:12:11.033 --> 00:12:12.700
Phantump. Phantump.

229
00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:15.700
- Wait up!
- Denne!

230
00:12:16.966 --> 00:12:19.566
