Not acceptable. They catch up and we're toast.

232
00:12:23.566 --> 00:12:24.833
Pedal to the metal!

233
00:12:27.566 --> 00:12:28.400
Huh?

234
00:12:33.833 --> 00:12:35.233
I've got you!

235
00:12:36.033 --> 00:12:37.400
You're all right.

236
00:12:37.933 --> 00:12:40.200
Hold on. What happened to the others?

237
00:12:40.466 --> 00:12:41.300
Tump? Tump?

238
00:12:44.166 --> 00:12:46.333
They must have gone somewhere.

239
00:12:47.733 --> 00:12:48.900
Aw.

240
00:12:48.966 --> 00:12:51.566
I wanted to play with all of them.

241
00:12:51.633 --> 00:12:53.566
- Denn-enn-enn.
- Phantump.

242
00:12:56.933 --> 00:12:59.433
Phantump. Phantump.

243
