247
00:13:13.633 --> 00:13:14.766
Hey. Hey!

248
00:13:17.533 --> 00:13:19.000
Phantump.

249
00:13:21.833 --> 00:13:23.500
Huh? Phantump!

250
00:13:23.566 --> 00:13:24.500
Pika.

251
00:13:25.733 --> 00:13:28.766
- Phantump. Phantump, Phantump.
- Phantump.

252
00:13:29.233 --> 00:13:31.266
Phantump! Phantump! Phantump!

253
00:13:31.333 --> 00:13:34.633
