254
00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:37.566
I think so. They were looking all this time.

255
00:13:37.633 --> 00:13:40.600
- Phantump. Phantump, Phantump.
- Phantump?

256
00:13:40.666 --> 00:13:41.833
Phantump.

257
00:13:42.233 --> 00:13:44.100
I think they're saying "come here."

258
00:13:44.166 --> 00:13:46.500
- Let's go check it out.
- Right.

259
00:13:49.966 --> 00:13:51.600
Phantump, Phantump.

260
00:13:52.266 --> 00:13:54.600
- Phantump, Phantump.
- Hey, wait!

261
00:13:54.666 --> 00:13:57.166
- Pika!
- I'd say we're a success.

262
00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.766
Finally my turn to shine.

263
00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:04.600
Phantump.

264
00:14:09.733 --> 00:14:11.600
- Pikachu.
- Phantump.

265
00:14:12.066 --> 00:14:14.400
Phantump, Phantump, Phantump.

266
00:14:15.333 --> 00:14:16.966
Yes! There they are!

267
00:14:20.833 --> 00:14:24.400
- Come on, wait for me, would you?
- Move. You can go faster.

268
00:14:24.466 --> 00:14:26.200
I'm doing the best I can.

269
00:14:26.566 --> 00:14:27.433
Ash.

270
00:14:28.833 --> 00:14:30.800
Huh? Hey.

271
00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:34.533
- It's one of my macarons.
- Why here?

272
00:14:36.233 --> 00:14:38.366
We rocked the house, didn't we?

273
00:14:38.433 --> 00:14:39.800
Wobbuffet!

274
00:14:40.233 --> 00:14:41.766
I could sure use a nap.

275
00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:43.233
Tump.

276
00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.500
Sorry, but we're not your friends.

277
00:14:46.733 --> 00:14:47.766
It's Team Rocket!

278
00:14:47.833 --> 00:14:49.300
- The twerps!
- The twerps!

279
00:14:49.366 --> 00:14:51.933
- What are you doing here?
- Getting busted.

280
00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.000
What tipped you off we were here?

281
00:14:54.066 --> 00:14:57.700
- We found Phantump's macaron.
- It never would've dropped it,

282
00:14:57.766 --> 00:15:01.600
- so we knew there was trouble.
- Let Phantump go right now!

283
00:15:01.666 --> 00:15:03.966
Curses. What can Jessie be doing?

284
00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:09.100
This Phantump needs relocation, and relocation is just what we'll do.

285
00:15:12.566 --> 00:15:13.766
Away!

286
00:15:14.933 --> 00:15:17.400
Phan! Phantump.

287
00:15:17.466 --> 00:15:19.866
That baby balloon worked like a charm!

288
00:15:19.933 --> 00:15:20.766
Go!

289
00:15:21.833 --> 00:15:24.333
- They're so horrible!
- Phantump!

290
00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.000
- Serena, let's go!
- Right!

291
00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.600
Tump!

292
00:15:28.666 --> 00:15:29.800
- Hmm?
- Huh?

293
00:15:29.866 --> 00:15:31.200
- Hey, are those--?
- Huh?

294
00:15:31.266 --> 00:15:32.500
Phantump!

295
00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.700
Phantump!

296
00:15:42.666 --> 00:15:45.633
- Great!
- And this time they're your real friends!

297
00:15:48.466 --> 00:15:51.566
- Phantump, are you okay?
- Phantump!

298
00:15:52.666 --> 00:15:55.466
- You know all of them, don't you?
- Phan.

299
00:15:56.166 --> 00:15:59.833
It's so wonderful they flew all this way to find Phantump.

300
00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:03.333
Phantump.

301
00:16:05.533 --> 00:16:09.366
- Phantump! Phantump, Phantump!
- Hey! Stop!

302
00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.166
What's going on?

303
00:16:19.233 --> 00:16:20.966
Pika pi!

304
00:16:21.033 --> 00:16:23.666
Prepare for trouble, it's what's flying off.

305
00:16:23.733 --> 00:16:26.166
Make it double, there's no time to scoff.

306
00:16:26.666 --> 00:16:31.500
- To protect the world from devastation.
- To unite all people within our nation.

307
00:16:31.566 --> 00:16:34.333
To denounce the evils of twerps and pests.

308
00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:37.166
To extend our reach to our most special guest.

309
00:16:38.033 --> 00:16:39.733
- Jessie.
- And James.

310
00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:42.800
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light.

311
00:16:43.166 --> 00:16:46.366
Surrender now or prepare for a balloon-powered fight.

312
00:16:46.433 --> 00:16:49.066
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

313
00:16:51.366 --> 00:16:52.400
Team Rocket!

314
00:16:52.466 --> 00:16:53.700
Pika, pika!

315
00:16:53.766 --> 00:16:57.866
Phantump's removed, now everything's a big bubble-filled groove.

316
00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:02.466
My only regret is my award-winning performance wasn't captured on film.

317
00:17:02.533 --> 00:17:04.666
Pikachu, Thunderbolt now!

318
00:17:05.466 --> 00:17:07.733
Pi!

319
00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:13.099
Please. A thousand Thunderbolts couldn't zap through our futuristic fiber fortress.

320
00:17:13.166 --> 00:17:14.666
Leaving you with less.

321
00:17:16.866 --> 00:17:17.700
Stop!

322
00:17:18.366 --> 00:17:19.866
Pika pi!

323
00:17:19.933 --> 00:17:22.200
Wobbu, wobbu, wobbu!

324
00:17:22.266 --> 00:17:23.700
Pikachu!

325
00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:29.866
What's with the ventriloquism?

326
00:17:29.933 --> 00:17:34.333
- I wouldn't throw my voice for a prank.
- I know where that's coming from.

327
00:17:34.766 --> 00:17:36.900
It's those babbling Phantump!

328
00:17:38.266 --> 00:17:40.700
- What's going on?
- Hey, Ash.

329
00:17:41.166 --> 00:17:43.633
All of Phantump's friends came to save it.

330
00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.633
Dedenne.

331
00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:47.033
- Well, what do you know?
- Phantump!

332
00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:54.833
Pika!

333
00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.333
- Pikachu!
- Pika pi!

334
00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:01.933
- So glad you're okay.
- Pika, pika.

335
00:18:03.666 --> 00:18:06.500
The nerve! You're not raining on our parade!

336
00:18:06.566 --> 00:18:08.400
Phantump! Phantump! Phantump!

337
00:18:08.466 --> 00:18:12.200
Check this. Not only did we steal their sweets without asking,

338
00:18:12.266 --> 00:18:16.600
but we had the gall to be really mean and nasty to their buddy as well.

339
00:18:16.666 --> 00:18:17.500
Don't tell.

340
00:18:18.033 --> 00:18:21.500
- That was just wrong, and you know it.
- Pika!

341
00:18:21.566 --> 00:18:25.433
We were hungry! There's such a thing as sharing, you know.

342
00:18:25.633 --> 00:18:28.766
Now, Gourgeist. Blacken their world with Dark Pulse!

343
00:18:28.833 --> 00:18:30.833
Okay, Inkay, use Psybeam!

344
00:18:33.166 --> 00:18:34.500
- Gourgeist.
- Inkay.

345
00:18:34.966 --> 00:18:36.666
- Gourgeist!
- Inkay!

346
00:18:36.733 --> 00:18:37.966
Phantump!

347
00:18:42.166 --> 00:18:43.700
Phantump, way to go!

348
00:18:43.766 --> 00:18:47.200
Tump!

349
00:18:54.266 --> 00:18:57.200
- Okay, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!
- Pika!

350
00:18:57.666 --> 00:19:02.300
Pikachu!

351
00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.233
We're blasting off again!

352
00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:06.866
- Wobbu!
- Inkay!

353
00:19:09.333 --> 00:19:11.500
You did it! You did it!

354
00:19:12.966 --> 00:19:15.000
- Yippee! Ha, ha.
- Phantump!

355
00:19:20.666 --> 00:19:23.000
- Here. Eat up.
- Everybody.

356
00:19:23.633 --> 00:19:25.366
Phantump! Phantump!

357
00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.166
Phantump, take care of yourself.

358
00:19:32.233 --> 00:19:35.166
- And don't get lost again, okay?
- Pika, pika.

359
00:19:35.733 --> 00:19:38.166
Phantump. Phantump.

360
00:19:39.133 --> 00:19:40.933
- Diglett.
- Dug, dug, dug.

361
00:19:41.466 --> 00:19:42.466
Bibarel.

362
00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.633
- Phantump.
- Phantump.

363
00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:45.933
Phantump.

364
00:19:46.466 --> 00:19:47.866
Phantump.

365
00:19:49.133 --> 00:19:50.266
Phantump, tump.

366
00:19:51.433 --> 00:19:54.866
Wow, it's introducing all of its new friends.

367
00:19:55.333 --> 00:19:58.266
You can never have too many, so always make more.

368
00:19:58.333 --> 00:19:59.566
Pikachu.

369
00:20:01.033 --> 00:20:04.700
- Bye, everybody. Take good care.
- Pika, pika!

370
00:20:04.766 --> 00:20:06.366
- Bye-bye!
- Dedenne.

371
00:20:06.933 --> 00:20:10.033
Happily, the rare Phantump with unusual coloring

372
00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.866
made it safely back home.

373
00:20:11.933 --> 00:20:16.433
And our heroes are once again setting their sights on Snowbelle City.

374
00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:25.033
I'm starving.

375
00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:28.466
Maybe one of those losers dropped a morsel or two on the ground.

376
00:20:28.533 --> 00:20:29.600
Wobbu.

377
00:20:31.666 --> 00:20:33.100
That laughing!

378
00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.433
I'm scramming out of here!

379
00:20:39.333 --> 00:20:42.766
- Ha, ha. You've gotta be kidding me.
- No, really. I'm serious.

380
00:20:42.833 --> 00:20:43.900
Huh?

381
00:20:44.833 --> 00:20:47.266
As the journey continues.
